{
  "$comment": [
    "SF Symbol → Lucide icon name, for porting the app's icon set to the web",
    "client's icon library. Keys are the SF Symbol names that appear in the Swift",
    "sources; values are canonical Lucide names (validated against",
    "scripts/lucide-codepoints.json by scripts/gen-lucide-icons.mjs).",
    "A null value means Lucide has no equivalent and the call site needs a real",
    "decision — a filled status dot is a shape in the web UI, not an icon.",
    "Names chosen to match what the web client imports from lucide-react for the",
    "same concept, so the two clients read as one product."
  ],
